 poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673450/extras/e645215d0f3584098ba2e1bd28aea2f1.poster.avif?t=1746538262\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673450/extras/e645215d0f3584098ba2e1bd28aea2f1.webm?t=1746538262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673450/extras/e645215d0f3584098ba2e1bd28aea2f1.mp4?t=1746538262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>TimeLock VR</strong> offers a fully functional environment with lots of interactions: you can throw objects, open every cabin, turn lighting on and off and much more.<br><br>Each room can be visited in different timelines.",
